WEBVTT

NOTE Draft 2026-10-05: combined 30s prologue + 30s crash storyboard.
Align every cue to final recorded speech and effects before shipping.
Captions are external and editable; this file is not yet wired into the player.

prologue-01
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
GUILD OFFICER: Welcome, Captain.
Your crew works for the Merchant Corporation.

prologue-02
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
NARRATOR: Other planets need oil, gold,
and silver to make useful things.

prologue-03
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
GUILD OFFICER: Explore this island.
Look for ores—rocks that hold valuable metals.

prologue-04
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
NARRATOR: Trade brings materials for homes,
food shipments, and travel between planets.

prologue-05
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
GUILD OFFICER: Your discoveries could help the company
earn money—and reveal new materials.

prologue-06
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
RHO: I'm Rho, your first mate.
Ready, Captain? Let's explore.

crash-01-fx
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.000
[Wind and rain rise; tense music]

crash-01
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:35.000
RHO: Captain!
The storm is pushing us down!

crash-02-fx
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:35.700
[Metal groans; alarm sounds]

crash-02
00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:40.000
RHO: We can't stay on the ship.
Pull the blue handle!

crash-03-fx
00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:42.000
[Escape seats release; wind rushes]

crash-03
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:45.000
RHO: The parachutes are open!

crash-04-fx
00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.000
[Distant crash and splash]

crash-04-surf
00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.000
[Gentle surf]

crash-05
00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
RHO: You're safe, Captain.
Our crew is out there.

crash-05-music
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:55.000
[Hopeful music rises]

crash-06
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:00.000
RHO: Let's find our supplies.
Then we'll find the crew.
